   <p begin="00:09:33.240" end="00:09:35.284" style="s1"><span style="s2"><span style="s3"><span style="s4">頸</span><span style="s5">けい</span></span><span style="s3"><span style="s4">部</span><span style="s5">ぶ</span></span>へのＤＳＳチョーカーは？</span></p> 
   <p begin="00:09:35.409" end="00:09:38.078" style="s1"><span style="s2">（リツコ）<br />すでに装着済みよ　<span style="s3"><span style="s4">葛城</span><span style="s7">かつらぎ</span></span>艦長</span></p> 
