   <p begin="00:09:41.164" end="00:09:42.874" style="s1"><span style="s2">やっぱりミサトさん？</span></p> 
   <p begin="00:09:43.000" end="00:09:43.959" region="縦右">（ピピッという音）</p> 
   <p begin="00:09:43.959" end="00:09:44.251" region="縦右">（ピピッという音）</p> 
   <p begin="00:09:43.959" end="00:09:44.251" style="s1"><span style="s2">おっ あれ？</span></p> 
   <p begin="00:09:44.251" end="00:09:45.210" style="s1"><span style="s2">おっ あれ？</span></p> 
